SELECT count() FROM zeros(10000000) WHERE NOT ignore(multiIf( rand(1) % 2 = 0, materialize(1::Nullable(Decimal256(3))), rand(2) % 2 = 0, materialize(2::Nullable(Decimal256(3))), rand(3) % 2 = 0, materialize(3::Nullable(Decimal256(3))), rand(4) % 2 = 0, materialize(4::Nullable(Decimal256(3))), rand(5) % 2 = 0, materialize(5::Nullable(Decimal256(3))), materialize(6::Nullable(Decimal256(3)))))